WEBVTT

00:00.550 --> 00:02.570
Imagine a team that never logs off.

00:03.150 --> 00:04.590
Give them a real computer,

00:05.100 --> 00:06.480
and watch them get to work.

00:08.700 --> 00:12.560
This is open-bot. Your AI teammates, and the computer they share.

00:14.600 --> 00:21.430
Hire teammates for the jobs you never get to. Research, shopping, travel, and a chief of staff to run the rest.

00:24.450 --> 00:26.430
Ask Milo to find flights to Lisbon.

00:30.850 --> 00:32.350
Milo: On it! Opening Google Flights.

00:33.200 --> 00:36.950
He works in a real browser, on his own screen. Every click, live.

00:38.300 --> 00:41.090
Want to step in? Take over, and he stops right away.

00:42.000 --> 00:43.280
Hand it back with a note,

00:44.750 --> 00:45.970
Milo: Got it. Nonstop only.

00:47.900 --> 00:50.640
Penny: Okay to pay forty-five dollars at Onyx Coffee?

00:51.600 --> 00:54.590
Anything risky waits for your OK, even on your phone.

00:56.450 --> 01:02.510
Got a big job? Penny splits it across helpers, each on a screen of their own, and brings back one answer.

01:04.200 --> 01:05.430
They work while you sleep.

01:06.050 --> 01:07.280
Remember what you like.

01:08.450 --> 01:09.870
Never see your passwords.

01:10.600 --> 01:11.950
Stay inside your budget.

01:12.550 --> 01:14.480
And soon, they'll even make your calls.

01:20.600 --> 01:21.460
open-bot.

01:22.150 --> 01:23.750
Open source, and all yours.
